A085,A085.pdf,10.3389/fpsyg.2026.1939286,11,"= 0.245). The pattern is consistent with a dual-route interpretation in which the direct path operates primarily for less reflective learners. FIGURE 4 Simple-slope plot of the moderation of GenAI feedback literacy → critical thinking by reflective thinking. At high reflective thinking, feedback literacy strongly predicts critical thinking (β = +0.243, p < 0.001); at low reflective thinking the slope is shallower and non-significant (β = +0.105, p = 0.066). The indirect path through feedback literacy is therefore stronger amongst more reflective learners.",83
