A130,A130.pdf,10.1007/s10639-025-13337-7,17,"12697 Education and Information Technologies (2025) 30:12681–12707 = 0.099]. Post-hoc comparisons using the Tukey HSD test indicated that the mean score for AI-Assisted Code Refiners (M = 8.35, SD = 3.22) was significantly higher than AI-Reliant Code Generators (M = 5.5, SD = 3.49), p = .008. These results may suggest that students with higher previous knowledge more tend to behave like AI- Assisted Code Refiners. 4.4 Association between AI interaction profiles and students’ performance (RQ4) A total of 143 students in the 1st session, 146 students in the 2nd session, and 140 students in the 3rd session both took the post-test and uploaded their ChatGPT con- versation histories. The post-test scores (out of 2 points) for each session based on AI interaction profiles are presented in Table 5. For the 1st session, the Shapiro-Wilk test indicated that the AI-Reliant Code Generators showed a small deviation from normality, W (45) = 0.949, p = .045, while other profiles did not (all p values > 0.17). Since the data size is large (> 30), normality was assumed (Gravetter & Wallnau, 2011).",180
A130,A130.pdf,10.1007/s10639-025-13337-7,17,"Code Generators showed a small deviation from normality, W (45) = 0.949, p = .045, while other profiles did not (all p values > 0.17). Since the data size is large (> 30), normality was assumed (Gravetter & Wallnau, 2011). Levene’s test con- firmed the homogeneity of variances across profiles with non-significant results (all p values > 0.51). Based on one-way ANOVA results, there was a signifi- cant difference in post-test scores across the different AI interaction profiles, F (4, 138) = 5.43, p < .001, with small effect size, η²= 0.14. Post-hoc compar- isons using the Tukey HSD test revealed that AI-Assisted Code Refiners had Table 4 Change of students’ AI interaction profiles across 2nd session to 3rd session (N = 136) 2nd Session Profile 3rd Session Profile Count Percent AI-reliant code generator AI-reliant code generator 5 16.13% AI-reliant code generator & refiner 8 25.81% AI-collaborative coder 16 51.61% AI-independent coder 2 6.45% AI-reliant code generator & refiner AI-reliant code generator 8 18.60% AI-reliant code generator & refiner 13 30.23% AI-collaborative coder 15 34.88% AI-assisted code refiner 5 11.63%",180
