DOC_063,s42438-026-00697-7.pdf,10.1007/s42438-026-00697-7,8,"methods and generative AI tools (Ansone et al. 2025) 2. Women constitute a majority of medical stu- dents in Australia, yet remain underrepresented in common portrayals of the medical profession. Generative AI can produce biased or inaccurate outputs, including in text-to-image systems, which raises concerns about how such tools represent medical students (Currie et al. 2024) Reimaginator Reinterprets existing data in a novel way. The input serves as the basis for editing while the semantics remain stable; innovates existing material while only modifying parts of its contextual semantics (e.g., runwayML) Tools that transform existing learning materials into new formats while preserving core content — e.g., converting a lecture transcript into a slide deck, simplifying a research article for a different reading level, or restyling a text for a different cultural context 1. Generative AI in Design Thinking education shapes students’ creativity, critical thinking, and ethical reasoning. Student reflections using tools such as ChatGPT and DALL·E show perceived benefits for creativity and access, alongside concerns about bias and authorship. Attitudes shift from skepticism to adoption, with growing emphasis on critically evaluating",180
DOC_063,s42438-026-00697-7.pdf,10.1007/s42438-026-00697-7,8,"creativity, critical thinking, and ethical reasoning. Student reflections using tools such as ChatGPT and DALL·E show perceived benefits for creativity and access, alongside concerns about bias and authorship. Attitudes shift from skepticism to adoption, with growing emphasis on critically evaluating AI outputs (Rana et al. 2025) 2. Generative AI, including large language mod- els, has the potential to transform healthcare and medical education, reshaping both learning and teaching. However, it raises ethical concerns and questions about assessment reliability. Medical curricula may need to adapt to its growing role in practice and research (Shimizu et al. 2023)",96
